{OT}.$" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244925 1113 #uuid "fe9c9bfe-4a90-5821-aa8d-37fc516d145c" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244925 1138 false 13194139533660 true] [17592186244925 1145 "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AT}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OA}=a,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{AT}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OAB,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{AB} & =\\overset{\\to }{AO}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{OB} \\\\  & =-a+b \\\\  & =b-a.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $AT:TB=1:6,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{AT}=\\frac{1}{7}\\overset{\\to }{AB}=\\frac{1}{7}(b-a).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OT} & =\\overset{\\to }{OA}+\\overset{\\to }{AT} \\\\  & =a+\\frac{1}{7}(b-a) \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{7}a+\\frac{1}{7}b.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244927 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244928 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244929 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244930 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244931 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1041 "selection" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244928 13194139533660 true] [17592186244926 1110 #uuid "e0560624-2f58-52b9-b266-3523a08fa423" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244927 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{3}{7}a+\\frac{1}{7}b" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244927 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533660 true] [17592186244927 1111 #uuid "ce5854b7-7cbf-54a7-bc43-e0aa8f2cc5a4" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244928 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OT}=\\frac{6}{7}a+\\frac{1}{7}b" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244928 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533660 true] [17592186244928 1111 #uuid "175a712f-79d0-59bd-a541-80bd960f4d