apture/13931259/assets/040127594f639248736d4492f1853bcb1e6ef18c37db9242ebe466045713628a.png)\n\nConsider the diagram above, where $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=u,$ $\\overset{\\to }{OV}=v$ and $W$ divides $\\overset{―}{UV}$ in the ratio $UW:WV=2:7.$ Find $\\overset{\\to }{OW}.$" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244991 1113 #uuid "2af4a406-e134-5401-990f-61dd08996b3c" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244991 1138 false 13194139533660 true] [17592186244991 1145 "From the diagram, we see that\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{OW}=\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW}.\n$$\n\nWe're told that $\\overset{\\to }{OU}=u,$ so we just need to work out $\\overset{\\to }{UW}.$\n\nFirst, from $△OUV,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{UV} & =\\overset{\\to }{UO}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{OV} \\\\  & =-u+v \\\\  & =v-u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $UW:WV=2:7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\overset{\\to }{UW}=\\frac{2}{9}\\overset{\\to }{UV}=\\frac{2}{9}(v-u).\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{OW} & =\\overset{\\to }{OU}+\\overset{\\to }{UW} \\\\  & =u+\\frac{2}{9}(v-u) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{9}u+\\frac{2}{9}v.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244993 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244994 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244995 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244996 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1000 #edb/ref 17592186244997 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1041 "selection" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1104 #edb/ref 17592186244995 13194139533660 true] [17592186244992 1110 #uuid "ee483764-dc6f-568b-bd11-a98dda2f857a" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244993 1034 "\\overset{\\to }{OW}=-\\frac{1}{3}v+\\frac{2}{3}u" 13194139533660 true] [17592186244993 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533660 true] [17592186244993 1111 #uuid "29336052-c4a9-5